### 1. Create a Case
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/cases
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Watts Family Case",
  "description": "True crime media tracking and timeline indexing"
}

###

### 2. Create a Milestone for the Case
# Replace YOUR_CASE_ID_HERE with the 'id' returned from Request 1
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/cases/0314d94e-9b17-483f-8137-8a4188b54185/milestones
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Initial Investigation & Media Coverage",
  "description": "Coverage of early search efforts and timeline setup",
  "event_date": "2018-08-13T00:00:00Z"
}

###

### 3. Create a Video linked to the Milestone
# Replace YOUR_MILESTONE_ID_HERE with the 'id' returned from Request 2
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/videos
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "milestone_id": "cd3df64e-2186-4b72-ae01-d2c0c6578cef",
  "youtube_video_id": "dQw4w9WgXcQ",
  "title": "Test True Crime Ingestion Video",
  "channel_name": "Crime Archive",
  "published_at": "2026-01-15T10:00:00Z",
  "category": "news"
}